{
 "about": "Timeline instructions (appendix A 22, 23, 25, 26): the list X returns at an operation's ...instructions root, read into entries in X's order. {\"$post\": id} stands for a minimal tweet result {__typename: Tweet, rest_id: id, core: {user_results: {result: user A}}, legacy: {full_text: 'post <id>', created_at: 'Thu Oct 15 10:00:00 +0000 2026'}}; {\"$user\": id} for a minimal user result with that rest_id and handle user_<id>. expected: entries as [kind, id, module, index, pinned] (kind post | account | trend | event | branch; module is the module entry id or null; index the position in it), bottom (the next-page cursor or null), branches (ShowMore cursors inside a module: where more of a collapsed branch can be read), terminated, cleared, promoted (ads skipped), other (items that are none of these, counted not shown). source: code (previous timeline.py, pages.py), measured (planning session), P2 (shape not seen live).",
 "users": {
  "A": {
   "__typename": "User",
   "rest_id": "1000000001",
   "core": {
    "screen_name": "example_author",
    "name": "Example Author"
   },
   "legacy": {}
  }
 },
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "entries-and-bottom-cursor",
   "item": "22,23",
   "source": "code",
   "fact": "TimelineAddEntries carries items and cursors; the top-level Bottom cursor is the next page, a Top cursor is not.",
   "instructions": [
    {
     "type": "TimelineAddEntries",
     "entries": [
      {
       "entryId": "tweet-1850000000000000001",
       "content": {
        "entryType": "TimelineTimelineItem",
        "itemContent": {
         "itemType": "TimelineTweet",
         "tweet_results": {
          "result": {
           "$post": "1850000000000000001"
          }
         }
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "entryId": "tweet-1850000000000000002",
       "content": {
        "entryType": "TimelineTimelineItem",
        "itemContent": {
         "itemType": "TimelineTweet",
         "tweet_results": {
          "result": {
           "$post": "1850000000000000002"
          }
         }
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "entryId": "cursor-top-1",
       "content": {
        "entryType": "TimelineTimelineCursor",
        "cursorType": "Top",
        "value": "TOPCUR"
       }
      },
      {
       "entryId": "cursor-bottom-1",
       "content": {
        "entryType": "TimelineTimelineCursor",
        "cursorType": "Bottom",
        "value": "BOTCUR1"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "expected": {
    "entries": [
     [
      "post",
      "1850000000000000001",
      null,
      0,
      false
     ],
     [
      "post",
      "1850000000000000002",
      null,
      0,
      false
     ]
    ],
    "bottom": "BOTCUR1",
    "branches": [],
    "terminated": false,
    "cleared": false,
    "promoted": 0,
    "other": 0
   }
  },
